Package: yamaa
Title: Clinical Data Specifications with the Shared Rust Engine
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Ming-Chun", "Chen", email = "hellomingchun@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds clinical data specifications, checks declarations, and
    renders submission metadata through the shared Rust engine. Returns owned
    data frames and structured diagnostics, with explicit publication of
    retained outputs and lossless signed 64-bit integer and UTF-8 values.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.6.1)
SystemRequirements: Cargo, rustc (>= 1.90.0), GNU make
NeedsCompilation: yes
